  "question": {
    "text": "If the common tangent to the parabolas,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi></math> also touches the circle,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math> is equal to :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "XosHM",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
