  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#38;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Comparing with standard equations,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>y</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Therefore tangent of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;which is&nbsp;also tangent to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></math>, whose equation would be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;common tangent is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;which&nbsp;touches <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
